<title>GERMANY: Leica posts 10.7 pct rise in 96 sales.</title>
<headline>Leica posts 10.7 pct rise in 96 sales.</headline>
<dateline>SOLMS, Germany 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  265.6   up 10.7</p>
<p>    Group gross operating result	   69.2    up slightly</p>
<p>from last year's level</p>
<p>    Earnings before interest and taxes   15.2    down 7.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German camera maker is Leica Camera AG. The group said it expects to post good results and sales growth of at least 10 percent in 1997.</p>
</text>
